# Facade methods

> Fuente: https://laravelmodules.com/docs/1/advanced/facade-methods
> Exportado: 2026-07-23 20:01 UTC

Get all modules.

Copied!

```
Module::all();

Module::all();
```

Get all cached modules.

Copied!

```
Module::getCached()

Module::getCached()
```

Get ordered modules. The modules will be ordered by the `priority` key in `module.json` file.

Copied!

```
Module::getOrdered();

Module::getOrdered();
```

Get scanned modules.

Copied!

```
Module::scan();

Module::scan();
```

Find a specific module.

Copied!

```
Module::find('name');

// OR

Module::get('name');

Module::find('name');
// OR
Module::get('name');
```

Find a module, if there is one, return the `Module` instance, otherwise throw `Nwidart\Modules\Exeptions\ModuleNotFoundException`.

Copied!

```
Module::findOrFail('module-name');

Module::findOrFail('module-name');
```

Get scanned paths.

Copied!

```
Module::getScanPaths();

Module::getScanPaths();
```

Get all modules as a collection instance.

Copied!

```
Module::toCollection();

Module::toCollection();
```

Get modules by the status. 1 for active and 0 for inactive.

Copied!

```
Module::getByStatus(1);

Module::getByStatus(1);
```

Check the specified module. If it exists, will return `true`, otherwise `false`.

Copied!

```
Module::has('blog');

Module::has('blog');
```

Get all enabled modules.

Copied!

```
Module::enabled();

Module::enabled();
```

Get all disabled modules.

Copied!

```
Module::disabled();

Module::disabled();
```

Get count of all modules.

Copied!

```
Module::count();

Module::count();
```

Get module path.

Copied!

```
Module::getPath();

Module::getPath();
```

Register the modules.

Copied!

```
Module::register();

Module::register();
```

Boot all available modules.

Copied!

```
Module::boot();

Module::boot();
```

Get all enabled modules as collection instance.

Copied!

```
Module::collections();

Module::collections();
```

Get module path from the specified module.

Copied!

```
Module::getModulePath('name');

Module::getModulePath('name');
```

Get assets path from the specified module.

Copied!

```
Module::assetPath('name');

Module::assetPath('name');
```

Get config value from this package.

Copied!

```
Module::config('composer.vendor');

Module::config('composer.vendor');
```

Get used storage path.

Copied!

```
Module::getUsedStoragePath();

Module::getUsedStoragePath();
```

Get used module for cli session.

Copied!

```
Module::getUsedNow();

// OR

Module::getUsed();

Module::getUsedNow();
// OR
Module::getUsed();
```

Set used module for cli session.

Copied!

```
Module::setUsed('name');

Module::setUsed('name');
```

Get modules's assets path.

Copied!

```
Module::getAssetsPath();

Module::getAssetsPath();
```

Get asset url from specific module.

Copied!

```
Module::asset('blog:img/logo.img');

Module::asset('blog:img/logo.img');
```

Install the specified module by given module name.

Copied!

```
Module::install('nwidart/hello');

Module::install('nwidart/hello');
```

Update dependencies for the specified module.

Copied!

```
Module::update('hello');

Module::update('hello');
```

Add a macro to the module repository.

Copied!

```
Module::macro('hello', function() {

echo "I'm a macro";

});

Module::macro('hello', function() {
    echo "I'm a macro";
});
```

Call a macro from the module repository.

Copied!

```
Module::hello();

Module::hello();
```

Get all required modules of a module

Copied!

```
Module::getRequirements('module name');

Module::getRequirements('module name');
```
